# steps/named-struct-exec.md: slice 2 executes a named Structure from the root; a bare `Counter` in a
# method body stays refused until slice 3 (natively through lmx_call_prim, and under the knob).
Counter:
    size_t: n 0U
    n: n + 1U
return
fn: bump () int
    Counter
return: 0
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: bump(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
